WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.216
Administrative units are
the delegation replacement,

2
00:00:03.216 --> 00:00:06.037
so their limits shape the
whole delegation model.

3
00:00:06.037 --> 00:00:08.665
They don't nest, so the
tree becomes a flat set,

4
00:00:08.665 --> 00:00:12.462
and a role covering several units
gets one assignment per unit.

5
00:00:12.462 --> 00:00:15.638
They limit who can change
members, not who can see them.

6
00:00:15.638 --> 00:00:18.062
Only some roles can be scoped to a unit.

7
00:00:18.062 --> 00:00:22.310
Dynamic units work in G C C,
but not in G C C High or D O D,

8
00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:25.937
where an automation job
has to keep them up.

9
00:00:25.937 --> 00:00:30.260
And restricting a unit takes its
members out of governance automation,

10
00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:33.263
so restriction is a deliberate
choice, default no.

11
00:00:33.263 --> 00:00:35.450
Next, Lifecycle Workflows.
